# Sacrifice to the Sea (Q154): a level 2 character accepts at Rockswell; Rolfe and Cristel have
# nothing yet; ten bearded keltirs give ten fox furs (every roll pinned to succeed); Cristel
# spins them into yarn, Rolfe makes the yarn a maiden doll, and Rockswell takes the doll for an
# earring and experience; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q154_sacrifice_to_the_sea.golden
character Sailor 2
random always 0
script quest.Q154_SacrificeToTheSea
